<title>JAPAN: Tobu Store -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tobu Store -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    58.97		vs	   61.83</p>
<p> Operating   loss 203    million	  vs   loss 107    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 283    million	  vs   loss 303    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 274    million	  vs    loss 66    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 5.37 yen	  vs     loss 1.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     51 million	  vs	  51 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tobu Store Co Ltd is a supermarket chain operator affiliated with Tobu Railway Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
